insert into public.units values ('functions','algebra','{"id":"functions","title":"Functions","x":260,"y":350,"requires":["expressions","equations"],"lessons":[{"id":"function","title":"Inputs and outputs","explanation":"A function assigns exactly one output to each input. Substitute the input for x.","example":"For f(x) = 2x + 1, f(3) = 7.","questions":[{"id":"f1","prompt":"If f(x) = 3x − 2, find f(4).","answer":"10","hint":"Substitute 4 for x.","explanation":"3 × 4 − 2 = 10.","kind":"numeric","difficulty":"easy"},{"id":"f2","prompt":"If g(x) = x² + 1, find g(−3).","answer":"10","hint":"Square −3 before adding 1.","explanation":"(−3)² + 1 = 9 + 1 = 10.","kind":"numeric","difficulty":"easy"}]}],"grades":[8,9]}') on conflict(id) do update set content=excluded.content;
